   "explanation": "Site-specific rules for RD exception 258: a 1.2 m side yard setback, a 3.6 m setback from a side lot line that abuts a street, a maximum of 2 storeys excluding the basement, and the existing lot area for undersized lawfully created lots. The lands must also comply with exception 1462.",
