   "explanation": "Site-specific rules for RD exception 117: a 9.0 m front setback, 0.9 m side setback, 3.6 m setback from a side lot line that abuts a street, and a garage may sit 0.3 m from a side lot line. The lands must also comply with exception 1462.",
   "code_refs": "none"
  },
  "900.3.10(528)": {
   "explanation": "Site-specific rules for RD exception 528: minimum lot frontage and area are those existing on the day of enactment, a 3.0 m front setback, a 1.0 m side setback on one side only, the required parking space must be in a building, and a garage entrance facing the street must be set back 6.0 m.",
